<h2 style="margin:0 0 10px;
           font-family:'Orbitron','Montserrat',Arial,sans-serif;
           color:#00209F; font-size:20px; letter-spacing:0.08em; text-transform:uppercase;">
  Verify your email
</h2>

<p style="margin:0 0 14px;font-family:'Inter',Arial,sans-serif;color:#1b2559;font-size:14px;line-height:1.65;">
  Hello <strong><%= @visitor.first_name %></strong>,
</p>

<p style="margin:0 0 14px;font-family:'Inter',Arial,sans-serif;color:#1b2559;font-size:14px;line-height:1.65;">
  Use the verification code below to continue your <strong>BonTouris ID</strong> application.
</p>

<div style="text-align:center; margin:18px 0 14px;">
  <div style="display:inline-block;
              font-family:'Montserrat','Inter',Arial,sans-serif;
              font-size:28px; letter-spacing:6px; font-weight:800;
              color:#00209F; background:#f1f4ff;
              padding:14px 18px; border-radius:10px;
              border:1px solid rgba(0,32,159,0.15);">
    <%= @visitor.email_otp %>
  </div>
</div>

<p style="margin:0;font-family:'Montserrat','Inter',Arial,sans-serif;color:rgba(27,37,89,0.85);font-size:12.5px;line-height:1.6;">
  This code expires in <strong>10 minutes</strong>. If you didn’t request this, you can safely ignore this email.
</p>
